The Way of heaven, is it not like drawing a bow?
The high, it depresses;
The low, it raises;
The have-more, it reduces;
The have-less, it supplements.
The Way of heaven: reduces the have-more, supplements the have-less.
The Way of people: is not so, it reduces the have-less to serve the have-more.
Who is able to have-more to serve the world? Only those who have the Way.
Therefore the sage embraces the uncarved block to be the world's pattern.
